Njc3MTM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/56677134?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint","html_url":"https://github.com/chocola-mint","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chocola-mint/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-03-27T14:44:18Z","updated_at":"2026-03-27T14:45:53Z","body":"@8reaks\r\nNow that's a good question.\r\n\r\nThis bug technically *also* affects GraphElements too if you try to move them with another GraphNode at the same time.\r\n![godot_editor_undo_redo_graph_element](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8ac997b-8825-43aa-9469-4a9e22a97305)\r\n\r\nFor GraphElements, the editor is able to successfully revert the `position` property back to the previous value upon undo, but `position_offset` is still left as-is. I'm not sure why it can't do the same for GraphNodes. I suspect it's because that GraphEdit also does some drawing for each GraphNode. It listens to `position_offset_changed` for example to update the port connections and the minimap.\r\n\r\nIn either case, `position_offset` is not reverted properly in the inspector so at the very least this PR will fix that.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4143129624/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]